{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "Decision": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Decisión"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Décision"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Describe a place you know well to someone who has never been there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Describe un lugar que conozcas bien a alguien que nunca ha estado allí."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Décrivez un endroit que vous connaissez bien à quelqu’un qui n’y est jamais allé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Describe something that broke or went wrong recently and how you worked it out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuenta algo que se rompió o salió mal hace poco y cómo lo resolviste."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Racontez une chose qui s’est cassée ou a mal tourné récemment, et comment vous l’avez résolue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diary": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diario"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Journal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Double-tap %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pulsar %@ dos veces"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toucher deux fois %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explain to a smart, non-technical friend why you run your own server instead of using cloud services.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Explica a un amigo listo pero no técnico por qué tienes tu propio servidor en vez de usar servicios en la nube."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Expliquez à un ami curieux mais pas technicien pourquoi vous avez votre propre serveur au lieu d’utiliser des services cloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feedback": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opinión"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give honest feedback on someone's idea or piece of work, kind but direct.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Da una opinión sincera sobre la idea o el trabajo de alguien, amable pero directa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Donnez un avis honnête sur l’idée ou le travail de quelqu’un, bienveillant mais franc."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instructions": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instrucciones"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instructions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lay out a decision you're weighing, the options, and which way you're leaning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Expón una decisión que estés valorando, las opciones y hacia cuál te inclinas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exposez une décision que vous pesez, les options, et vers laquelle vous penchez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opinion": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opinión"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opinion"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick a tool, product or habit you feel strongly about and argue for or against it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige una herramienta, un producto o un hábito que te importe y defiéndelo o critícalo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisissez un outil, un produit ou une habitude qui vous tient à cœur et défendez-le ou critiquez-le."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Place": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lugar"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lieu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Problem story": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Historia de un problema"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Récit d’un problème"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recap": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resumen"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compte rendu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
